# ============================================
# Archived/deleted benchmarks (kept on disk, not tracked)
# ============================================
Benchmarking/_archive/
Benchmarking/xenium_pseudovisium/_archive/
Benchmarking/xenium_benchmarking/_archive/
Benchmarking/simulation_benchmarking/_archive/
# Any nested _archive/ or _archive_<suffix>/ anywhere under the tree.
# Without these, only the top-level _archive/ above is ignored, and dirs like
# Benchmarking/xenium_benchmarking/CITEgeist/_archive/ leak in on `git add`.
**/_archive/
**/_archive_*/
# Method-comparison results directory (re-derived from per-method outputs)
Benchmarking/xenium_benchmarking/evaluation/results/method_comparison/

